{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful hand-drawn world teeming with secrets and whimsical creatures. Master fast-paced combat and deep crafting in a colorful 2D sandbox adventure that lets you build, explore, and write your own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/dce5eb4be1a2e49d130a2451df410ed6.poster.avif?t=1759327385\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/dce5eb4be1a2e49d130a2451df410ed6.webm?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/dce5eb4be1a2e49d130a2451df410ed6.mp4?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A beautiful hand-drawn world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a lush forest, traverse treacherous snowy peaks, and delve into a mystical, glowing cave, and many more. Every corner of the world is a unique biome waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/6b6f90f27cf911917fd41252b265e287.poster.avif?t=1759327385\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/6b6f90f27cf911917fd41252b265e287.webm?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/6b6f90f27cf911917fd41252b265e287.mp4?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master fast-paced combat with dynamic abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a variety of whimsical creatures. Use your sword for close-quarters combat or your magic spells for ranged attacks. Customize your build to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/04e213936ee2bf1dd393460475d5c7ee.poster.avif?t=1759327385\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/04e213936ee2bf1dd393460475d5c7ee.webm?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/04e213936ee2bf1dd393460475d5c7ee.mp4?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet unique characters and trade for valuable resources</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with friendly spirits and creatures who will aid you on your journey. Trade for powerful items, learn ancient lore, and unlock new abilities by helping those in need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/f912f3dfd566bcf9b161c1896c516e6f.poster.avif?t=1759327385\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/f912f3dfd566bcf9b161c1896c516e6f.webm?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/f912f3dfd566bcf9b161c1896c516e6f.mp4?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take on powerful foes and claim epic loot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mighty bosses in your quest to save the world. Every victory brings you one step closer to your goal and rewards you with powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/4be14a57a0d38d95acf682fb9fa182a8.poster.avif?t=1759327385\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/4be14a57a0d38d95acf682fb9fa182a8.webm?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/4be14a57a0d38d95acf682fb9fa182a8.mp4?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover ancient ruins and hidden pathways</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of secrets to find and mysteries to solve. Use your platforming skills to reach new areas, discover hidden passages, and get lost in the magic of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/e197b75ee3ca60a0e6cdd492aeefbd88.poster.avif?t=1759327385\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/e197b75ee3ca60a0e6cdd492aeefbd88.webm?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4061600/extras/e197b75ee3ca60a0e6cdd492aeefbd88.mp4?t=1759327385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and customize your perfect home base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a sanctuary of your own. Gather resources to 